1
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:05,922
We'll be sharing a room

2
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:07,423
for a month?

3
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:08,966
God.

4
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:11,052
Don't do anything stupid.

5
00:00:11,052 --> 00:00:12,721
That goes for you, too.

6
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:27,986
Well, it's not that bad.

7
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:29,737
The bed is...

8
00:00:31,364 --> 00:00:32,364
This looks nice.

9
00:00:35,493 --> 00:00:36,493
Huh?

10
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:40,040
I told you
don't do anything stupid.

11
00:00:40,498 --> 00:00:40,957
Hey.

12
00:00:41,332 --> 00:00:43,251
I put my bag first!

13
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:45,331
You think you can play as
catcher with that eyesight?

14
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:48,757
I put mine precisely
a second before you.

15
00:00:49,007 --> 00:00:50,800
Wow, now your
eyes are not functioning well?

16
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:53,887
No, yours didn't fall first.

17
00:00:54,262 --> 00:00:55,262
My bag did.

18
00:00:56,598 --> 00:00:58,198
You think you can
be a pitcher like that?

19
00:00:59,476 --> 00:01:00,476
Anyway.

20
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:01,770
This is my spot.

21
00:01:01,895 --> 00:01:02,479
God.

22
00:01:02,687 --> 00:01:04,022
You're childish.

23
00:01:04,647 --> 00:01:05,940
I said my bag fell first!

24
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:06,940
For Pete's sake!

25
00:01:07,275 --> 00:01:09,152
My bag fell first!

26
00:01:09,486 --> 00:01:10,737
Okay whatever.
